Isolated `mars-field-scenes-v6`, **not registered or published**. Additive source/assets/tests only; no dependency on Elements or Doctrine packages, no runtime/UI changes. Current `mars-persistent-locations-v5` and all old direct routes/save identities remain intact.

## Restored cadence with honest places

24 chapter work areas plus the two already-earned internal destinations make26 persistent panels. The workcourt, furniture-sled path, night thermal bay, greenhouse propagation bench, basin comparison edge, return-packing alcove, oxygen service bay, cabin preparation bay and final assembly pad are distinct workstations/views, not same-place resets. Old objects stay owned by earlier panels unless useful carry actually moves them.

Consolidation had also moved future stock into earlier hubs. The exact current stock multiset is preserved, but each earlier source group opens at its intended work area: sampling case at the ice outcrop, survey case at the channel, unpacked field laboratory at the basin, comparison kit by the gravel, packing stores at camp, and vehicle modules at their separate depot bays. No source primitive or finished goal is invented. Substantive existing equipment provenance, including the two genuine power sources at the ice-melt station, remains intact; only moved-source location narratives change.

The three exact pre-consolidation curated carry lists (habitat, camp, homebound) are restored on their singleton visits. All other chapter visits use state-sensitive current-goal carry. The old lists were intentional: simply splitting visits without restoring them still brought19 items to the habitat rather than15. Rescue’s internal travel list is reduced from the union of several future camp chapters to the current recovery/refuge leg, including the optional repair kit for a towed crawler. The refuge arrival has9 local things on the canonical route; the orbital arrival has1 vehicle, with all cargo still fitted.

